  "description": "Pure-managed EXIF metadata reader and writer for .NET. Parses EXIF blobs from JPEG (APP1), TIFF (sub-IFD), and PNG (eXIf chunk) — all of which share the same TIFF-IFD structure. Strongly-typed projection of well-known tags + raw tag map for the long tail / vendor MakerNote. Write (3.22): ExifWriter.Build makes a TIFF-structured EXIF blob (Software, ImageDescription, Artist, DateTime, UserComment) that SharpAstro.Jpeg's JpegEncodeOptions.Exif embeds as an APP1 segment.",
